    <string name="term_settings_keys_footer">The arrows sit in the middle of the key bar; the whole bar scrolls. Swiping on the terminal works like the pad: sideways for ← and →, a quick flick up or down for ↑ and ↓ while the terminal shows its end (slower drags scroll back). Keep your finger down to repeat.</string>
