    <string name="term_settings_keep_connected">Keep connected in the background</string>
    <string name="term_settings_background_footer">Terminals on your Mac keep running there when the connection drops, also with this app closed, and pick up where they left off. With this on, aOS keeps its connection while a terminal is open and the app is in the background, and shows a notification with a button to end the session. Off: the connection goes 25 seconds after you leave the app.</string>
